{"abstract": [{"text": "People depend on their iPhone to help them stay connected, play games, view", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "media, accomplish tasks, and track personal data in any location and while on", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "the go.", "type": "text"}], "hierarchy": {"paths": [["doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/technologies", "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/human-interface-guidelines", "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/getting-started"]]}, "identifier": {"interfaceLanguage": "swift", "url": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/designing-for-ios"}, "kind": "article", "legalNotices": {"copyright": "Copyright &copy; 2026 Apple Inc. All rights reserved.", "privacyPolicy": "https://www.apple.com/privacy/privacy-policy", "termsOfUse": "https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/terms/site.html"}, "metadata": {"availableLanguages": ["en-US", "zh-CN", "ja-JP", "ko-KR"], "images": [{"identifier": "ios.svg", "type": "icon"}, {"identifier": "platforms-designing-for-ios-thumbnail.png", "type": "card"}], "role": "article", "title": "Designing for iOS"}, "primaryContentSections": [{"content": [{"inlineContent": [{"identifier": "platforms-iOS-intro.png", "type": "image"}], "type": "paragraph"}, {"inlineContent": [{"text": "As you begin designing your app or game for iOS, start by understanding the", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "following fundamental device characteristics and patterns that distinguish the", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "iOS experience. Using these characteristics and patterns to inform your design", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "decisions can help you provide an app or game that iPhone users appreciate.", "type": "text"}], "type": "paragraph"}, {"inlineContent": [{"inlineContent": [{"text": "Display.", "type": "text"}], "type": "strong"}, {"text": " iPhone has a medium-size, high-resolution display.", "type": "text"}], "type": "paragraph"}, {"inlineContent": [{"inlineContent": [{"text": "Ergonomics.", "type": "text"}], "type": "strong"}, {"text": " People generally hold their iPhone in one or both hands as they", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "interact with it, switching between landscape and portrait orientations as", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "needed. While people are interacting with the device, their viewing distance", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "tends to be no more than a foot or two.", "type": "text"}], "type": "paragraph"}, {"inlineContent": [{"inlineContent": [{"text": "Inputs.", "type": "text"}], "type": "strong"}, {"text": " Multi-Touch", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"identifier": "https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/gestures", "isActive": true, "type": "reference"}, {"text": ",", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"identifier": "https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/virtual-keyboards", "isActive": true, "type": "reference"}, {"text": ",", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "and ", "type": "text"}, {"identifier": "https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/siri", "isActive": true, "type": "reference"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "control let people perform actions and accomplish meaningful tasks while", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "they\u2019re on the go. In addition, people often want apps to use their", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"identifier": "https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/privacy", "isActive": true, "type": "reference"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "and input from the device\u2019s ", "type": "text"}, {"identifier": "https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/gyro-and-accelerometer", "isActive": true, "type": "reference"}, {"text": ",", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "and they may also want to participate in ", "type": "text"}, {"identifier": "https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/spatial-interactions", "isActive": true, "type": "reference"}, {"text": ".", "type": "text"}], "type": "paragraph"}, {"inlineContent": [{"inlineContent": [{"text": "App interactions.", "type": "text"}], "type": "strong"}, {"text": " Sometimes, people spend just a minute or two checking on", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "event or social media updates, tracking data, or sending messages. At other", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "times, people can spend an hour or more browsing the web, playing games, or", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "enjoying media. People typically have multiple apps open at the same time, and", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "they appreciate switching frequently among them.", "type": "text"}], "type": "paragraph"}, {"inlineContent": [{"inlineContent": [{"text": "System features.", "type": "text"}], "type": "strong"}, {"text": " iOS provides several features that help people interact", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "with the system and their apps in familiar, consistent ways.", "type": "text"}], "type": "paragraph"}, {"items": [{"content": [{"inlineContent": [{"identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/widgets", "isActive": true, "type": "reference"}], "type": "paragraph"}]}, {"content": [{"inlineContent": [{"identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/home-screen-quick-actions", "isActive": true, "type": "reference"}], "type": "paragraph"}]}, {"content": [{"inlineContent": [{"identifier": "https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/searching", "isActive": true, "type": "reference"}], "type": "paragraph"}]}, {"content": [{"inlineContent": [{"identifier": "https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/siri#Shortcuts-and-suggestions", "isActive": true, "type": "reference"}], "type": "paragraph"}]}, {"content": [{"inlineContent": [{"identifier": "doc://com.apple.HIG/design/Human-Interface-Guidelines/activity-views", "isActive": true, "type": "reference"}], "type": "paragraph"}]}], "type": "unorderedList"}, {"anchor": "Best-practices", "level": 2, "text": "Best practices", "type": "heading"}, {"inlineContent": [{"text": "Great iPhone experiences integrate the platform and device capabilities that", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "people value most. To help your design feel at home in iOS, prioritize the", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "following ways to incorporate these features and capabilities.", "type": "text"}], "type": "paragraph"}, {"items": [{"content": [{"inlineContent": [{"text": "Help people concentrate on primary tasks and content by limiting the number of", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "onscreen controls while making secondary details and actions discoverable", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "with minimal interaction.", "type": "text"}], "type": "paragraph"}]}, {"content": [{"inlineContent": [{"text": "Adapt seamlessly to appearance changes \u2014 like device orientation, Dark Mode,", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "and Dynamic Type \u2014 letting people choose the configurations that work best", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "for them.", "type": "text"}], "type": "paragraph"}]}, {"content": [{"inlineContent": [{"text": "Support interactions that accommodate the way people usually hold their device.", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "For example, it tends to be easier and more comfortable for people to reach a", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "control when it\u2019s located in the middle or bottom area of the display, so", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "it\u2019s especially important let people swipe to navigate back or initiate", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "actions in a list row.", "type": "text"}], "type": "paragraph"}]}, {"content": [{"inlineContent": [{"text": "With people\u2019s permission, integrate information available through platform", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "capabilities in ways that enhance the experience without asking people to", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "enter data. For example, you might accept payments, provide security through", "type": "text"}, {"text": " ", "type": "text"}, {"text": "biometric authentication, or offer features that use the device\u2019s location.", "type": "text"}], "type": "paragraph"}]}], "type": "unorderedList"}, {"anchor": "Resources", "level": 2, "text": "Resources", "type": "heading"}, {"anchor": "Related", "level": 4, "text": "Related", "type": "heading"}, {"inlineContent": [{"identifier": "https://developer.apple.com/design/resources/#ios-apps", "isActive": true, "type": "reference"}], "type": "paragraph"}, {"anchor": "Developer-documentation", "level": 4, "text": "Developer documentation", "type": "heading"}, {"inlineContent": [{"identifier": "https://developer.apple.com/ios/get-started/", "isActive": true, "type": "reference"}], "type": "paragraph"}, {"anchor": "Videos", "level": 4, "text": "Videos", "type": "heading"}, {"items": ["doc://com.apple.documentation/videos/play/wwdc2025/219", "doc://com.apple.documentation/videos/play/wwdc2025/356"], "style": "compactGrid", "type": "links"}], "kind": "content"}], "schemaVersion": {"major": 0, "minor": 3, "patch": 0}, "sections": [], "topicSectionsStyle": "compactGrid", "references": {"1AAA030E-2ECA-47D8-AE09-6D7B72A840F6": {"alt": null, "identifier": "1AAA030E-2ECA-47D8-A